#: GameServer/RpcHandlers.lean:33
msgid "level completed! 🎉"
msgstr "– 关卡完成！ –"

#: GameServer/RpcHandlers.lean:41
msgid "level completed with warnings… 🎭"
msgstr "– 关卡完成！但不完全是按预想的方式 –"

#: GameServer/RpcHandlers.lean:54
msgid "intermediate goal solved! 🎉"
msgstr "– 中间目标证明完成！ –"

#. §0: `f`
#. §1: ```
#. ∀ a b, f a = f b → a = b
#. ```
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:8
msgid ""
"A mapping §0 is injectiv, if:\n"
"\n"
"§1"
msgstr ""
"一个映射 §0 当且仅当满足以下条件时是单射：\n"
"\n"
"§1"

#. §0: `f`
#. §1: ```
#. ∀ b, ∃ a, f a = b
#. ```
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:18
msgid ""
"A mapping §0 is surjectiv, if:\n"
"\n"
"§1"
msgstr ""
"一个映射 §0 当且仅当满足以下条件时是满射：\n"
"\n"
"§1"

#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:27
msgid "A mapping ist bijectiv, if it is injektiv and surjektiv."
msgstr "一个映射是双射，当且仅当它既是单射又是满射。"

#. §0: `f`
#. §1: ```
#. ∀ ⦃a b⦄, a < b → f a < f b
#. ```
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:33
msgid ""
"A mapping §0 is strictly monotonous, if:\n"
"\n"
"§1"
msgstr ""
"一个映射 §0 是严格单调的，当且仅当：\n"
"\n"
"§1"

#. §0: `RightInverse f g`
#. §1: `LeftInverse g f`
#. §2: `∀ x, g (f x) = x`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:43
msgid ""
"§0 is defined as §1.\n"
"In other words: §2."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `LeftInverse g f`
#. §1: `g ∘ f = id`
#. §2: `∀ x, g (f x) = x`
#. §3: `unfold`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:51
msgid ""
"§0 means §1, or more exactly:\n"
"§2, as can be seen with §3."
msgstr "§0 的意思是 §1，或者更准确地说：§2，你用 §3 很容易就能展开。"

#. §0: `HasRightInverse f`
#. §1: `f`
#. §2: `HasLeftInverse f`
#. §3: `f`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:58
msgid ""
"§0 means, that §1 has a right inverse.\n"
"\n"
"§2 means, that §3 has left inverse."
msgstr ""
"§0 表示 §1 有一个右逆。\n"
"\n"
"§2 表示 §3 有一个左逆。"

#. §0: `f : A → A`
#. §1: `a : A`
#. §2: `IsFixedPt f a`
#. §3: `f a = a`
#. §4: `unfold IsFixedPt`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:66
msgid ""
"For a self-mapping §0 and an element §1, §2 is the expression §3.\n"
"Look up definition with §4."
msgstr ""
"对一个自映射 §0 和一个元素 §1，§2 就是断言 §3。\n"
"你可以用 §4 很容易把定义展开写出来。"

#. §0: `f : A → A`
#. §1: `fixedPoints f : Set A`
#. §2: `f `
#. §3: `unfold fixedPoints`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:72
msgid ""
"For a mapping §0, §1 is the set of fixed points of §2.\n"
"Look up definition with §3."
msgstr ""
"对一个映射 §0，§1 是 §2 的不动点集合。\n"
"你可以用 §3 很容易把定义展开写出来。"

#. §0: `A`
#. §1: `B`
#. §2: `S`
#. §3: `A B : Set S`
#. §4: `A ∪ B`
#. §5: `∪`
#. §6: `\\union`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:78
msgid ""
"For two subsets §0 and §1 of §2 (i.e. §3), §4 is their union.\n"
"§5 is written as §6."
msgstr ""
"对 §2 的两个子集 §0 和 §1（也就是 §3），§4 是它们的并集。\n"
"\n"
"你把 §5 写作 §6。"

#. §0: `A`
#. §1: `S`
#. §2: `A : Set S`
#. §3: `Aᶜ`
#. §4: `ᶜ`
#. §5: `\\compl`
#. §6: `\\^c`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:84
msgid ""
"For subsets §0 of §1 (i.e. §2), §3 is the complement.\n"
"§4 is written as §5 or §6."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `A`
#. §1: `B`
#. §2: `S`
#. §3: `A B : Set S`
#. §4: `A ∩ B`
#. §5: `∩`
#. §6: `\\inter`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:90
msgid ""
"For two subsets §0 and §1 of §2 (i.e. §3), §4 is their intersection.\n"
"§5 is written as §6."
msgstr ""
"对 §2 的两个子集 §0 和 §1（也就是 §3），§4 是它们的交集。\n"
"\n"
"你把 §5 写作 §6。"

#. §0: `f : A → B`
#. §1: `range f`
#. §2: `f`
#. §3: ```
#. range f = {f a | a : A}
#.         = {  b | ∃ a, f a = b}
#. ```
#. §4: `f '' univ`
#. §5: `mem_range`
#. §6: ```
#. x ∈ range f ↔ ∃ a, f a = b
#. ```
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:96
msgid ""
"For a mapping §0, §1 is the full image set of §2:\n"
"§3\n"
"Is a diffierent notation for §4.\n"
"§5 is useful to work with it:\n"
"§6"
msgstr ""
"对一个映射 §0，§1 是 §2 的整个像集：\n"
"§3\n"
"所以这基本上就是 §4 的另一种写法。\n"
"要处理这个记号，§5 很有用：\n"
"§6"

#. §0: `f : A → B`
#. §1: `image f : Set A → Set B`
#. §2: `A`
#. §3: `f '' A`
#. §4: `f`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:110
msgid ""
"For a mapping §0, §1\n"
"is one of the induced mappings on the power sets –\n"
"it maps a subset of §2 to the image §3 of this subset under §4."
msgstr "对一个映射 §0，§1 是作用在幂集上的一个诱导映射——它把 §2 的一个子集映到该子集在 §4 下的像 §3。"

#. §0: `f : A → B`
#. §1: `preimage f : Set B → Set A`
#. §2: `B`
#. §3: `f ⁻¹' A`
#. §4: `f`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:117
msgid ""
"For a mapping §0, §1\n"
"is one of the induced mappings on the power sets –\n"
"it maps a subset of §2 to the preimage §3 of this subset under §4."
msgstr "对一个映射 §0，§1 是作用在幂集上的一个诱导映射——它把 §2 的一个子集映到该子集在 §4 下的原像 §3。"

#. §0: `f : A → B`
#. §1: `S`
#. §2: `A`
#. §3: ```
#. f '' S = {f a | a ∈ S} = {b | ∃ a ∈ S, f a = b}
#. ```
#. §4: `f`
#. §5: `f`
#. §6: `''`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:125
msgid ""
"For a mapping §0 and a subset §1 of §2,\n"
"§3\n"
"is its image under §4.  Note the space between §5 and §6."
msgstr ""
"对一个映射 §0 和 §2 的一个子集 §1，\n"
"§3\n"
"是 §1 在 §4 下的像。\n"
"注意 §5 和 §6 之间的空格。"

#. §0: `f : A → B`
#. §1: `T`
#. §2: `B`
#. §3: ```
#. f ⁻¹' T = { a | f a ∈ T}
#. ```
#. §4: `f`
#. §5: `f \\-1'`
#. §6: `f`
#. §7: `\\-1'`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:134
msgid ""
"For a mapping §0 and a subset §1 of §2,\n"
"§3\n"
"is its preimage under §4.\n"
"You write this as §5.\n"
"Note the space between §6 and §7."
msgstr ""
"对一个映射 §0 和 §2 的一个子集 §1，\n"
"§3\n"
"是 §1 在 §4 下的原像。\n"
"\n"
"你把它写作 §5。\n"
"注意 §6 和 §7 之间的空格。"

#. §0: `fun x ↦ _`
#. §1: `fun (x : ℤ) ↦  -x`
#. §2: `ℤ → ℤ`
#. §3: `↦`
#. §4: `\\maps`
#. §5: `\\mapsto`
#. §6: `↦`
#. §7: `=>`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:145
msgid ""
"The notation §0 is used to define “anonymous functions.”\n"
"For example, §1 defines the negation §2 without giving it a name.\n"
"You write the arrow §3 as §4 or §5.\n"
"Alternatively, instead of §6 you can use §7."
msgstr ""
"记号 §0 用来定义“匿名函数”。\n"
"比如，§1 定义了取反函数 §2，但不给它起名字。\n"
"\n"
"箭头 §3 你写成 §4 或 §5。\n"
"另外，你也可以用 §7 来代替 §6。"

#. §0: `A : Set T`
#. §1: `A`
#. §2: `T`
#. §3: `A`
#. §4: `T`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:156
msgid ""
"§0 means that §1 is a subset of §2\n"
"(or, more precisely, that §3 is a set consisting of elements of type §4)."
msgstr "§0 的意思是 §1 是 §2 的一个子集（或者更准确地说，§3 是一个集合，它由类型为 §4 的元素组成）。"

#. §0: `A : Set T`
#. §1: `a`
#. §2: `T`
#. §3: `T`
#. §4: `a ∈ A`
#. §5: `a`
#. §6: `A`
#. §7: `A = { a : T | P a }`
#. §8: `a ∈ A`
#. §9: `simp`
#. §10: `P a`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:162
msgid ""
"For a subset §0 and an element §1 from §2 (more precisely: of type §3), §4 means that\n"
"§5 is in §6.\n"
"For subsets of the form §7, you can simplify the statement\n"
"§8 with §9 to §10."
msgstr ""
"对一个子集 §0 和一个来自 §2 的元素 §1（更准确地说：\n"
"类型是 §3），§4 表示 §5 属于 §6。\n"
"\n"
"对于形如 §7 的子集，你可以用 §9 把命题 §8 化简成 §10。"

#. §0: `P : T → Prop`
#. §1: `{ a : T | P a } : Set P`
#. §2: ```
#. { n : ℕ | Even n }
#. ```
#. §3: `a ∈ { a : T | P a }`
#. §4: `simp`
#. §5: `P a`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:170
msgid ""
"For a predicate §0, §1 is the subset\n"
"consisting of all elements that satisfy the predicate.  For example,\n"
"§2\n"
"is the set of even natural numbers.\n"
"You can simplify the statement §3, using §4, to §5 ."
msgstr ""
"对一个谓词 §0，§1 是由所有满足该谓词的元素组成的子集。\n"
"比如说，\n"
"§2\n"
"就是偶自然数的集合。\n"
"\n"
"命题 §3 你可以用 §4 化简成 §5。"

#. §0: `(A B : Set T)`
#. §1: `A\\B`
#. §2: `A`
#. §3: `B`
#. §4: `A`
#. §5: `B`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:181
msgid ""
"For two subsets §0, §1 is the difference between §2 and §3,\n"
"consisting of all elements of §4 that are not in §5."
msgstr "对两个子集 §0，§1 是 §2 和 §3 的差集，由所有属于 §4 但不属于 §5 的元素组成。"

#. §0: `A B : Set T`
#. §1: `A ⊆ B`
#. §2: `A`
#. §3: `B`
#. §4: `rw [subset_iff]`
#. §5: `A ⊆ B`
#. §6: `∀ x, x ∈ A → x ∈ B`
#. §7: `A ⊆ B`
#. §8: `intro a ha`
#. §9: `a`
#. §10: `ha : a ∈ A`
#. §11: `a ∈ B`
#. §12: `h : A ⊆ B`
#. §13: `a`
#. §14: `ha : a ∈ A`
#. §15: `have hb := h ha`
#. §16: `hb : a ∈ B`
#. §17: `⊆`
#. §18: `\\subset`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:187
msgid ""
"For §0, §1 means that §2 is contained in §3.\n"
"\n"
"With §4, you can rewrite §5 as §6.\n"
"\n"
"If §7 is the proof goal, you can also directly use §8\n"
"to select an element §9 with §10 (and then show §11).\n"
"\n"
"If §12 is an assumption and an element §13 with §14 is given,\n"
"you can use §15 to obtain the statement §16.\n"
"\n"
"You write §17 as §18."
msgstr ""
"对 §0 来说，§1 的意思是 §2 包含在 §3 里。\n"
"你可以用 §4 把它改写成 §6。\n"
"\n"
"## §1 作为目标\n"
"\n"
"用 §8 你先取一个任意元素 §9 并假设 §10（然后就得证明 §11）。\n"
"\n"
"## §1 作为假设\n"
"\n"
"如果 §12 是一个假设，并且给定一个元素 §13 满足 §14，那么用 §15 你就得到命题 §16。\n"
"\n"
"你把 §17 写作 §18。"

#. §0: `∅ : Set T`
#. §1: `∅ : Set ℕ`
#. §2: `∅ : Set ℝ`
#. §3: `rw [eq_empty_iff_forall_notMem]`
#. §4: `S = ∅`
#. §5: `∀ (x : T), x ∉ s`
#. §6: `∅`
#. §7: `\\emptyset`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:202
msgid ""
"§0 is the empty subset.\n"
"In the Formaloverse §1 is something different than §2\n"
"– one is a subset of ℕ, the other is a subset of ℝ!\n"
"\n"
"With §3 you translate the equation §4 into the\n"
"statement §5.\n"
"\n"
"§6 is written as §7."
msgstr ""
"§0 是空子集。\n"
"在 Lean宇宙里，§1 和 §2 是不一样的——一个是 ℕ 的子集，另一个是 ℝ 的子集！\n"
"\n"
"用 §3 你可以把一个形如 §4 的等式改写成命题 §5。\n"
"\n"
"你把 §6 写作 §7。"

#. §0: `univ : Set T`
#. §1: `T`
#. §2: `rw [eq_univ_iff_forall]`
#. §3: `S = univ`
#. §4: `∀ (x : T), x ∈ S`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:214
msgid ""
"§0 is the “subset” consisting of *all* elements of type §1.\n"
"\n"
"With §2, you convert an equation of the form §3 into the\n"
"statement §4."
msgstr ""
"§0 是由类型为 §1 的*所有*元素组成的“子”集合。\n"
"\n"
"用 §2 你可以把一个形如 §3 的等式转成命题 §4。"

#. §0: `A : Finset T`
#. §1: `a : T`
#. §2: `insert a A`
#. §3: `A ∪ {a}`
#. §4: `a`
#. §5: `A`
#. §6: `insert a A = A`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:222
msgid ""
"For a finite subset §0 and an element §1,\n"
"§2 is another way of writing §3.\n"
"If §4 is already in §5, then obviously §6."
msgstr ""
"对一个有限子集 §0 和一个元素 §1，§2 是 §3 的另一种写法。\n"
"如果 §4 已经在 §5 里了，那显然 §6。"

#. §0: `A : Finset T`
#. §1: `a : T`
#. §2: `erase A a`
#. §3: `A \\ {a}`
#. §4: `a`
#. §5: `A`
#. §6: `erase A a = A`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:229
msgid ""
"For a finite subset §0 and an element §1,\n"
"§2 is another way of writing §3.\n"
"If §4 is not in §5 at all, then obviously §6."
msgstr ""
"对一个有限子集 §0 和一个元素 §1，§2 是 §3 的另一种写法。\n"
"如果 §4 根本不在 §5 里，那显然 §6。"

#. §0: `A : Finset T`
#. §1: `card A : ℕ`
#. §2: `A`
#. §3: `A`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:236
msgid ""
"For a finite subset §0, §1 is the cardinality of §2,\n"
"i.e., the number of elements in §3."
msgstr "对一个有限子集 §0，§1 是 §2 的基数，也就是 §3 里的元素个数。"

#. §0: `n : ℕ`
#. §1: `Fin n`
#. §2: $\\{0, \\dots, n-1\\}$
#. §3: `Fin n`
#. §4: `Icc 0 (n-1)`
#. §5: `Fin n`
#. §6: `Fin n : Type`
#. §7: `Icc 0 (n-1) : Finset ℕ`
#. §8: `ℕ`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:242
msgid ""
"For §0, §1 is the set §2.\n"
"\n"
"(§3 is to be distinguished from §4:\n"
"§5 is a set, or more precisely a type, i.e. §6,\n"
"whereas §7 is a finite subset of §8.)"
msgstr ""
"对 §0 来说，§1 就是集合 §2。\n"
"\n"
"（§3 要和 §4 区分开来：\n"
"§5 是一个集合，或者更准确地说是一个类型，也就是 §6，而 §7 是 §8 的一个有限子集。）"

#. §0: `Icc a b`
#. §1: $[a,b]$
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:251
msgid "§0 is the closed interval §1."
msgstr "§0 是闭区间 §1。"

#. §0: `Ioo a b`
#. §1: $(a,b)$
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:256
msgid "§0 is the open interval §1."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `Ioi a`
#. §1: `a`
#. §2: `ℝ`
#. §3: $(a,\\infty)$
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:261
msgid ""
"In an ordered set, §0 is the subset of all elements greater than §1.\n"
"For example, in §2 it is the open interval §3."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `Iio a`
#. §1: `a`
#. §2: `ℝ`
#. §3: $(-\\infty, a)$
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:267
msgid ""
"In an ordered ste, §0 is the subset of all elements less than §1.\n"
"For example, in §2 it is the open interval §3."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `𝓝 a`
#. §1: `a`
#. §2: `𝓝`
#. §3: `\\nhds`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:274
msgid ""
"§0 is the neighborhood filter: it consists of all neighborhoods of §1.\n"
"(A set is a neighboorhood of a point a it it contains an open set containing a.)\n"
"\n"
"To type the symbol §2, write §3."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `𝓝[s] a`
#. §1: `a`
#. §2: `s`
#. §3: `𝓝[>] (x : ℝ)`
#. §4: `𝓝[Set.Ioi x] x`
#. §5: `x`
#. §6: `𝓝[≠] x`
#. §7: `𝓝[{0}ᶜ] 0`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:281
msgid ""
"§0 is the filter of neighborhoods of §1 inside the set §2:\n"
"it consists of all sets that contain the intersection of s and a neighborhood of a.\n"
"\n"
"Two special cases:\n"
"\n"
"* §3 is short for §4: the points near §5 that are\n"
"  *greater* than x\n"
"* §6 is short for §7: the points near x that are *not equal*\n"
"  to x"
msgstr ""

#. §0: `Nonempty`
#. §1: `T`
#. §2: `T : Type`
#. §3: `Nonempty T`
#. §4: `A`
#. §5: `A : Set T`
#. §6: `Nonempty A`
#. §7: `∃ x, x ∈ A`
#. §8: `unfold Nonempty`
#. §9: `t`
#. §10: `t : T`
#. §11: `use t`
#. §12: `a`
#. §13: `a : T`
#. §14: `a ∈ A`
#. §15: `ha : a ∈ A`
#. §16: `use a`
#. §17: `h : Nonempty T`
#. §18: `obtain ⟨t⟩ := h`
#. §19: `t`
#. §20: `t : T`
#. §21: `h : Nonempty A`
#. §22: `obtain ⟨a, ha⟩ := h`
#. §23: `a`
#. §24: `a : T`
#. §25: `a ∈ A`
#. §26: `ha : a ∈ A`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:294
msgid ""
"[Doc.Definition] Nonempty\n"
"§0\n"
"for §1, §2, §3 means T is non-empty\n"
"for §4, §5, §6 means §7; check this with §8\n"
"As goal:\n"
"given §9, §10, use §11\n"
"given §12, §13 such that §14, §15, use §16\n"
"As assumption:\n"
"given §17, use §18 to obtain §19, §20\n"
"given §21, use §22 to obtain §23, §24, §25, §26"
msgstr ""
"对一个集合（更准确地说：一个“类型”）§1，§3 的意思是：在 §1（“类型为 §1”）里存在一个元素。\n"
"同样地，对一个子集 §5，表达式 §6 等价于 §7。后者你可以用 §8 很容易地检查。\n"
"\n"
"## §0 作为证明目标\n"
"\n"
"如果你已经给出或构造了一个元素 §10，你可以用 §11 证明 §3。\n"
"同样地，如果你有一个元素 §12 并且有 §14，那么你可以用 §16 证明 §6。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"## §0 作为假设\n"
"\n"
"对一个集合 §1，你可以用 §18 从假设 §17 中提取出一个 §20。\n"
"对一个子集 §5，你可以用 §22 从假设 §21 中提取出一个 §23，并且满足性质 §26。"

#. §0: `A : Set T`
#. §1: `Set.Finite A`
#. §2: `A`
#. §3: `h : Set.Finite A`
#. §4: `h.toFinset : Finset T`
#. §5: `A`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:335
msgid ""
"For a subset §0, §1 means that §2 has only a finite number of elements.\n"
"If §3 is given as an assumption, then §4 is the same subset §5,\n"
"but now explicitly understood as a finite subset."
msgstr ""
"对一个子集 §0，§1 表示 §2 只有有限多个元素。\n"
"如果 §3 作为假设给出，那么 §4 还是同一个子集 §5，但现在被明确地当作一个有限子集来看。"

#. §0: `(A : Prop)`
#. §1: `(True : Prop)`
#. §2: `(False : Prop)`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:345
msgid ""
"§0 is any statement, without further specification as to whether it is true, false, or\n"
"unprovable.\n"
"\n"
"See also §1 and §2 for the unconditionally true and false\n"
"statements, respectively."
msgstr ""
"§0 是一个任意命题，不额外说明它是真的、假的，还是根本不可证。\n"
"\n"
"另见 §1 和 §2：分别对应无条件为真和无条件为假的命题。"

#. §0: `A ∧ B`
#. §1: `A`
#. §2: `B`
#. §3: `A ∧ B`
#. §4: `constructor`
#. §5: `A`
#. §6: `B`
#. §7: `A ∧ B`
#. §8: `obtain ⟨h₁, h₂⟩ := h`
#. §9: `h : A ∧ B`
#. §10: `h₁ : A`
#. §11: `h₂ : B`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:354
msgid ""
"§0 (“and”) is the statement that both §1 and §2 are true.\n"
"\n"
"## §3 as a proof goal\n"
"\n"
"The tactic §4 allows you to prove the two sub-statements §5 and §6 individually.\n"
"\n"
"## §7 as an assumption\n"
"\n"
"With §8, you break down an assumption of the form §9\n"
"into its components §10 and §11."
msgstr ""
"§0（“A 和 B”）表示：§1 和 §2 都为真。\n"
"\n"
"## §3 作为目标\n"
"\n"
"策略 §4 允许你把两个子命题 §5 和 §6 分开来证明。\n"
"\n"
"## §7 作为假设\n"
"\n"
"用 §8 你可以把一个形如 §9 的假设拆成它的组成部分 §10 和 §11。"

#. §0: `A ∨ B`
#. §1: `A`
#. §2: `B`
#. §3: `A ∨ B`
#. §4: `left`
#. §5: `right`
#. §6: `A ∨ B`
#. §7: `A`
#. §8: `B`
#. §9: `A`
#. §10: `B`
#. §11: ```
#. obtain h | h := h
#. ```
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:368
msgid ""
"§0 (“or”) is the statement that at least one of the statements §1, §2 is true.\n"
"\n"
"## §3 as proof goal\n"
"\n"
"You can use the tactics §4 or §5 to decide\n"
"which statement you want to prove.\n"
"\n"
"## §6 as an assumption\n"
"\n"
"Since you do not know which of the statements §7 or §8 you can assume,\n"
"you may have to show the proof goal twice:\n"
"once under the assumption §9 and once under the assumption §10.\n"
"To do this, use the tactic\n"
"§11"
msgstr ""
"§0（“A 或 B”）的意思是：命题 §1、§2 至少有一个为真。\n"
"\n"
"## §3 作为证明目标\n"
"\n"
"用策略 §4 或者 §5，你可以决定你想证明哪一个命题。\n"
"\n"
"## §6 作为假设\n"
"\n"
"因为你不知道你可以假设 §7、§8 中的哪一个，所以你可能得把证明目标证明两次：\n"
"一次在假设 §9 下，一次在假设 §10 下。\n"
"为此你使用策略\n"
"§11"

#. §0: `A B : Prop`
#. §1: `A → B`
#. §2: `A`
#. §3: `B`
#. §4: `X Y : Type`
#. §5: `X → Y`
#. §6: `X`
#. §7: `Y`
#. §8: `A → B`
#. §9: `intro h`
#. §10: `h : A`
#. §11: `B`
#. §12: `apply`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:388
msgid ""
"For §0, §1 is the implication “§2 implies §3.”\n"
"For other §4, §5 is a mapping that maps values from §6 to §7.\n"
"\n"
"## Implication as proof goal\n"
"\n"
"If your proof goal is an implication §8, with §9 you can assume §10,\n"
"and then you must prove §11.\n"
"\n"
"## Implication as assumption\n"
"\n"
"To use an implication among your assumptions, use the tactic §12."
msgstr ""
"对 §0 来说，§1 就是蕴涵“§2 蕴涵 §3”。\n"
"对其他的 §4，§5 是一个映射，把 §6 里的值映到 §7。\n"
"\n"
"## 蕴涵作为目标\n"
"\n"
"如果你的目标是一个蕴涵 §8，那么你可以用 §9 假设 §10，然后就得证明 §11。\n"
"\n"
"## 蕴涵作为假设\n"
"\n"
"要在假设里使用一个蕴涵，你用策略 §12。"

#. §0: `A ↔ B`
#. §1: `A`
#. §2: `B`
#. §3: `↔`
#. §4: `A ↔ B`
#. §5: `constructor`
#. §6: `A → B`
#. §7: `B → A`
#. §8: `↔`
#. §9: `h : A ↔ B`
#. §10: `obtain ⟨h₁, h₂⟩ := h`
#. §11: `h₁ : A → B`
#. §12: `h₂ : B → A`
#. §13: `h.mp`
#. §14: `h.mpr`
#. §15: `mp`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:403
msgid ""
"§0 means that statements §1 and §2 are logically equivalent (“if and only if”).\n"
"\n"
"## §3 as proof target\n"
"\n"
"To show §4, you can, for example, call §5\n"
"and then prove §6 and §7 separately.\n"
"\n"
"## §8 as an assumption\n"
"\n"
"You can break down an assumption of the form §9 using §10 into its two components\n"
"§11 and §12.\n"
"However, you can also refer directly to these components with §13 and §14.\n"
"(The abbreviation §15 stands for “modus ponens”.)"
msgstr ""
"§0 表示命题 §1 和 §2 在逻辑上等价（“当且仅当”）。\n"
"\n"
"## 以 §3 为目标\n"
"\n"
"要证明 §4，你比如可以调用 §5，然后分别证明 §6 和 §7。\n"
"\n"
"## 以 §8 为假设\n"
"\n"
"形如 §9 的假设，你可以用 §10 把它拆成两个部分 §11 和 §12。\n"
"不过你也可以用 §13 和 §14 直接引用这些部分。\n"
"（缩写 §15 表示“modus ponens”。）"

#. §0: `P : A → Prop`
#. §1: `∃ a : A, P a`
#. §2: `a`
#. §3: `A`
#. §4: `A`
#. §5: `P a`
#. §6: `A`
#. §7: `∃ a : A, true`
#. §8: `Nonempty A`
#. §9: `∃`
#. §10: `∃ a : A, …`
#. §11: `a`
#. §12: `use`
#. §13: `use a`
#. §14: `∃`
#. §15: `h : ∃ a : A, P a`
#. §16: `choose a ha using h`
#. §17: `obtain ⟨a, ha⟩ := h`
#. §18: `a : A`
#. §19: `ha : P a`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:420
msgid ""
"Existential quantifier: If §0 is a predicate, then\n"
"§1 is the statement that an element §2 in §3 (more precisely: of type §4)\n"
"exists for which the statement §5 is true.\n"
"A pure existence statement (\"there is an element of type §6)\n"
"can be formulated, for example, as §7 or as §8.\n"
"\n"
"## §9 as a proof goal\n"
"\n"
"To prove a statement of the form §10,\n"
"you construct a suitable element §11 and then use the §12 tactic (§13).\n"
"\n"
"## §14 as an assumption\n"
"\n"
"You can decompose an assumption of the form §15 into its components using\n"
"§16 or §17 into §18 and §19."
msgstr ""
"存在量词：\n"
"如果 §0 是一个谓词，那么 §1 就是在说：在 §3 中存在一个元素 §2（更准确地说：\n"
"属于类型 §4），使得命题 §5 为真。\n"
"纯粹的存在性陈述“存在一个类型为 §6 的元素”例如可以写成 §7 或 §8。\n"
"\n"
"## §9 作为目标\n"
"\n"
"要证明形如 §10 的命题，你先构造一个合适的元素 §11，然后用 §12 策略（§13）。\n"
"\n"
"## §14 作为假设\n"
"\n"
"形如 §15 的假设，你可以用 §16 或 §17 把它拆成组成部分 §18 和 §19。"

#. §0: `P : A → Prop`
#. §1: `∃! a : A, P a`
#. §2: `a`
#. §3: `A`
#. §4: `A`
#. §5: `P a`
#. §6: `a`
#. §7: `a`
#. §8: `∃!`
#. §9: `∃! a : A, …`
#. §10: `a`
#. §11: `use`
#. §12: `use a`
#. §13: `simp`
#. §14: `P a ∧ ∀ a' : A, P a' → a' = a`
#. §15: `P a`
#. §16: `a`
#. §17: `a`
#. §18: `∃!`
#. §19: `h : ∃! a : A, P a`
#. §20: ```
#.   obtain ⟨a, h_exists, h_unique⟩ := h
#.   simp at h_unique
#. ```
#. §21: ```
#.    a : A
#.    h_exists : P a
#.    h_unique : ∀ (y : A), P y → y = a
#. ```
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:439
msgid ""
"Existential quantifier: If §0 is a predicate, then\n"
"§1 is the statement that *exactly one* element §2 in §3 (more precisely: of type §4)\n"
"exists for which the statement §5 is true.\n"
"The statement therefore has two parts: first, such an §6 exists, and second, §7 is unique.\n"
"## §8 as a proof goal\n"
"\n"
"To prove a statement of the form §9, first construct a suitable element §10 and\n"
"then use the §11 tactic (§12), usually immediately followed by §13.\n"
"The proof goal should then have the following form:\n"
"\n"
"§14\n"
"\n"
"On the left is §15: you still have to show that §16 has the required property.\n"
"On the right is the uniqueness statement: every element with this property is equal to §17.\n"
"\n"
"## §18 as an assumption\n"
"\n"
"You can prove an assumption of the form §19 with\n"
"\n"
"§20\n"
"into its components\n"
"§21\n"
"."
msgstr ""
"存在唯一量词：\n"
"如果 §0 是一个谓词，那么 §1 表示：在 §3 中（更准确地说：\n"
"在类型为 §4 的对象里）存在*恰好一个*元素 §2，使得命题 §5 为真。\n"
"所以这个命题有两部分：\n"
"第一，存在这样的 §6；第二，§7 是唯一的。\n"
"\n"
"## §8 作为目标\n"
"\n"
"要证明一个形如 §9 的命题，你先构造一个合适的元素 §10，然后使用 §11 策略（§12），通常紧接着再来一句 §13。\n"
"之后你的目标应该长这样：\n"
"\n"
"§14\n"
"\n"
"左边是 §15：\n"
"你还得证明 §16 具有所要求的性质。\n"
"右边是唯一性断言：\n"
"任何具有这个性质的元素都等于 §17。\n"
"\n"
"## §18 作为假设\n"
"\n"
"一个形如 §19 的假设，你可以用\n"
"\n"
"§20\n"
"把它拆成\n"
"§21\n"
"这些部分。"

#. §0: `P : A → Prop`
#. §1: `∀ a : A, P a`
#. §2: `P a`
#. §3: `a`
#. §4: `A`
#. §5: `a`
#. §6: `A`
#. §7: `∀`
#. §8: `∀ a : A, …`
#. §9: `intro a`
#. §10: `a`
#. §11: `∀`
#. §12: `h : ∀ a : A, P a`
#. §13: `a₀ : A`
#. §14: `h a₀`
#. §15: `P a₀`
#. §16: `specialize h a₀`
#. §17: `a`
#. §18: `h : P a₀`
#. §19: `a₀`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:474
msgid ""
"Universal quantifier: If §0 is a predicate, then\n"
"§1 is the statement that the statement §2 is true for all §3 in §4\n"
"(more precisely: for all §5 of type §6).\n"
"## §7 as a proof goal\n"
"To prove a statement of the form §8, first use §9 to select any element §10.\n"
"## §11 as an assumption\n"
"If §12 is an assumption and §13 is a concrete element, then §14 is a notation for §15.\n"
"\n"
"You can also use §16 to restrict the given assumption\n"
"over all possible §17 to an assumption §18 over this concrete §19."
msgstr ""
"全称量词：\n"
"如果 §0 是一个谓词，那么 §1 表示：命题 §2 对于 §4 中所有的 §3（更准确地说：\n"
"对于所有类型为 §6 的 §5）都成立。\n"
"\n"
"## §7 作为证明目标\n"
"\n"
"要证明一个形如 §8 的命题，你先用 §9 取一个任意元素 §10。\n"
"\n"
"## §11 作为假设\n"
"\n"
"如果 §12 是一个假设而 §13 是一个具体元素，那么 §14 是 §15 的一种记法。\n"
"你也可以用 §16 把“对所有可能的 §17 都成立”的给定假设，专门化成关于这个具体 §19 的假设 §18。"

#. §0: `True : Prop`
#. §1: `True`
#. §2: `tauto`
#. §3: `decide`
#. §4: `True`
#. §5: `True`
#. §6: `True`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:488
msgid ""
"The statement §0 is always true.\n"
"\n"
"## §1 as a proof target\n"
"\n"
"The tactics §2 and §3 conclude every proof with §4 as the proof target.\n"
"\n"
"## §5 as an assumption\n"
"\n"
"As an assumption, §6 is not helpful at all."
msgstr ""
"命题 §0 总是真的。\n"
"\n"
"## §1 作为目标\n"
"\n"
"策略 §2 和 §3 会在以 §4 为目标时结束任何证明。\n"
"\n"
"## §5 作为假设\n"
"\n"
"作为假设时，§6 完全没什么用。"

#. §0: `False : Prop`
#. §1: `False`
#. §2: `False`
#. §3: `contradiction`
#. §4: `False`
#. §5: `h : ¬ A`
#. §6: `apply h`
#. §7: `A`
#. §8: `¬ A`
#. §9: `A → False`
#. §10: `False`
#. §11: `False`
#. §12: `contradiction`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:501
msgid ""
"The statement §0 is always false.\n"
"\n"
"## §1 as proof target\n"
"\n"
"If §2 is your proof target, you can try to find a contradiction in your assumptions, for example.\n"
"Once the contradiction is sufficiently evident, §3 concludes such a proof.\n"
"\n"
"If §4 is your proof goal and you have an assumption or lemma of the form §5 available,\n"
"you can use §6 to change the proof goal to §7\n"
"(because §8 means §9).\n"
"\n"
"## §10  as an assumption\n"
"\n"
"If you have §11 as an assumption, you can immediately end the proof with §12\n"
"– because, as is well known, any other statement follows from a false statement."
msgstr ""
"命题 §0 总是假的。\n"
"\n"
"## §1 作为证明目标\n"
"\n"
"如果 §2 是你的证明目标，你比如可以试着在你的假设里找出一个矛盾。\n"
"一旦矛盾足够明显，§3 就能结束这样的证明。\n"
"\n"
"如果 §4 是你的证明目标，并且你手头有一个形如 §5 的假设或引理，那么你可以用 §6 把证明目标改成 §7（因为 §8 的意思是 §9）。\n"
"\n"
"## §10 作为假设\n"
"\n"
"如果你有 §11 作为假设，你可以立刻用 §12 结束证明——因为从一个假命题出发，众所周知可以推出任何别的命题。"

#. §0: `¬ A`
#. §1: `A`
#. §2: `A → False`
#. §3: `unfold Not`
#. §4: `push Not`
#. §5: `by_contra`
#. §6: `contrapose`
#. §7: `h : ¬ A`
#. §8: `apply`
#. §9: `False`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:520
msgid ""
"§0 is the logical negation of §1.\n"
"It is implemented internally as §2.  You can see this with §3.\n"
"\n"
"Useful tactics are: §4, §5, §6.\n"
"You can also apply an assumption of the form §7 using §8 to the proof target §9."
msgstr ""
"§0 是 §1 的逻辑否定。\n"
"它在内部被定义为 §2，你可以用 §3 很容易地检查这一点。\n"
"因此，你可以用 §8 把一个形如 §7 的假设应用到证明目标 §9 上。\n"
"\n"
"其他有用的策略有：\n"
"* §4\n"
"* §5\n"
"* §6"

#. §0: `rfl`
#. §1: `rw`
#. §2: `trans`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:529
msgid "Useful tactics for equality are: §0, §1, §2"
msgstr ""
"对等式有用的策略有：\n"
"* §0\n"
"* §1\n"
"* §2"

#. §0: `x ≠ y`
#. §1: `¬ x = y`
#. §2: `unfold Ne`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:534
msgid "Inequality §0 is defined as §1.  You can see this with §2."
msgstr "不等关系 §0 被定义为 §1。你可以用 §2 把它展开。"

#. §0: `Even n`
#. §1: `n : ℕ`
#. §2: ```
#. ∃ r : ℕ, n = r + r
#. ```
#. §3: `unfold Even`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:542
msgid ""
"§0 is the statement that §1 is even:\n"
"§2\n"
"You can easily check this with §3."
msgstr ""
"§0 表示 §1 是偶数：\n"
"§2\n"
"用 §3 你很容易就能检查这一点。"

#. §0: `Odd n`
#. §1: `n : ℕ`
#. §2: ```
#. ∃ k : ℕ, n = 2 * k + 1
#. ```
#. §3: `unfold Odd`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:551
msgid ""
"§0 is the statement that §1 is odd:\n"
"§2\n"
"You can easily check this with §3."
msgstr ""
"§0 表示 §1 是奇数：\n"
"§2\n"
"用 §3 你很容易就能检查这一点。"

#. §0: `n : ℕ`
#. §1: `Prime n`
#. §2: `n`
#. §3: `prime_def`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:560
msgid ""
"For §0, §1 means that §2 is a prime number.\n"
"To work with this definition, it is often helpful to rewrite it using the lemma\n"
"§3."
msgstr ""
"对 §0，§1 表示 §2 是一个素数。\n"
"要处理这个定义，通常用引理 §3 改写会很有帮助。"

#. §0: `succ : ℕ → ℕ`
#. §1: `n ↦ n + 1`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:567
msgid ""
"§0 is the mapping §1.\n"
"It therefore maps a natural number to its successor."
msgstr ""
"§0 是映射 §1。\n"
"也就是说，它把一个自然数映到它的后继（英文 *successor*）。"

#. §0: `n : ℤ`
#. §1: `n.toNat : ℕ`
#. §2: `n : ℤ`
#. §3: `n.toNat : ℕ`
#. §4: `n : ℕ`
#. §5: `(n : ℤ)`
#. §6: `↑n`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:573
msgid ""
"If §0 is an integer greater than or equal to 0, then §1 is the same number, interpreted as a natural number.\n"
"(If §2 is a negative integer, then §3 is also defined, but its value has no mathematical meaning.)\n"
"\n"
"## Friends and relatives\n"
"\n"
"A natural number §4 can always be interpreted as an integer.\n"
"To do this, you either write it explicitly as §5 or as §6."
msgstr ""
"如果 §0 是一个大于等于 0 的整数，那么 §1 就是同一个数，只不过把它看成自然数。\n"
"（如果 §2 是一个负整数，那么 §3 也同样有定义，但它的值没有数学意义。）\n"
"\n"
"## 相关策略\n"
"\n"
"一个自然数 §4 总是可以看成一个整数。\n"
"为此你要么把它显式写成 §5，要么写成 §6。"

#. §0: `x : ℝ`
#. §1: `|x|`
#. §2: `x`
#. §3: `|`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:586
msgid ""
"For §0, §1 is the absolute value of §2.\n"
"(Here, §3 is the usual vertical bar on the keyboard.)"
msgstr ""
"对 §0，§1 是 §2 的绝对值。\n"
"\n"
"（这里的 §3 是键盘上那个普通的竖线。）"

#. §0: `I : Finset T`
#. §1: `∑ i ∈ I, f i`
#. §2: $\\sum_{i\\in I} f(i)$
#. §3: `\\sum`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:600
msgid ""
"For a finite index set §0, §1 is Leanic notation for the sum\n"
"§2.  You write the summation sign as §3."
msgstr ""
"对于一个有限指标集 §0，§1 是 Lean语中表示求和 §2 的写法。\n"
"\n"
"你可以把求和符号写作 §3。"

#. §0: `I : Finset T`
#. §1: `∏ i ∈ I, f i`
#. §2: $\\prod_{i\\in I} f(i)$
#. §3: `\\prod`
#: Game/Doc/Definition.lean:606
msgid ""
"For a finite index set §0, §1 is the Leanic notation for the product\n"
"§2.  You write the product symbol as §3."
msgstr ""
