"## Variants\n"
"\n"
"* §3 additionally uses the assumption §4 or the lemma §5 for simplification\n"
"* §6 additionally uses the definition of §7\n"
"* §8 exclusively uses the assumptions/lemmas/definitions §9, §10, and §11\n"
"* §12 shows you which lemmas were used"
msgstr ""
"策略 §0 会尝试应用大量引理来化简给定的表达式。\n"
"\n"
"## 变体\n"
"\n"
"* §3 在化简时还会额外使用前提 §4 或引理 §5\n"
"* §6 还会额外使用 §7 的定义\n"
"* §8 只使用前提/引理/定义 §9、§10 和 §11\n"
"\n"
"*(在现实里，§0 比这个游戏里强得多：§0 会尝试应用所有在 §1 里用 §2 之类标记过的引理——而那可太多了！其中还有一些引理能一步解决这里给出的某些问题。所以在游戏里只允许使用其中很小的一部分。)*"

#. §0: `simp_rw`
#. §1: `rw`
#. §2: `simp_rw [h₁, h₂, h₃]`
#. §3: `h₁`
#. §4: `h₂`
#. §5: `h₃`
#. §6: `simp only []`
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:528
msgid ""
"§0 is a stronger form of §1.\n"
"§2 attempts to rewrite with each of §3, §4, §5, in this order.\n"
"The main differences to a plain rw are:\n"
"\n"
"* simp_rw applies each lemma/hypothesis as often as possible.\n"
"* simp_rw is better at rewriting under quantifiers and binders.\n"
"* simp_rw follows each step with §6"
msgstr ""

#. §0: `specialize h a₁ a₂`
#. §1: `have h := h a₁ a₂`
#. §2: `h : ∀ m₁ m₂, P m₁ m₂`
#. §3: `h : P a₁ a₂`
#. §4: `specialize`
#. §5: `have`
#. §6: `specialize h …`
#. §7: `h`
#. §8: `h`
#. §9: ```
#. have ha := h a₁ a₂
#. have hb := h b₁ b₂
#. ```
#. §10: ```
#. h : ∀ m₁ m₂, P m₁ m₂
#. ha : P a₁ a₂
#. hb : P b₁ b₂
#. ```
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:539
msgid ""
"§0 is equivalent to §1: the tactic replaces an assumption\n"
"§2 with the special case §3.\n"
"\n"
"If you want to specialize multiple times, instead of §4 you should use §5,\n"
"since §6 overwrites the old assumption §7.\n"
"From the above assumption §8, you can obtain the following three assumptions with\n"
"§9\n"
":\n"
"§10"
msgstr ""
"§0 等价于 §1：\n"
"这个策略会把一个假设 §2 替换成特例 §3。\n"
"\n"
"如果你想多次特化，最好用 §5 而不是 §4，因为 §6 会把旧的假设 §7 覆盖掉。\n"
"比如从上面的假设 §8 出发，你可以用\n"
"§9\n"
"得到下面这三个假设：\n"
"§10"

#. §0: `suffices h : P`
#. §1: `P`
#. §2: `P`
#. §3: `have h : P`
#. §4: `P`
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:560
msgid ""
"With §0, you introduce a proof section in which you show\n"
"that the desired proof goal follows from §1.\n"
"Then you prove §2.\n"
"\n"
"## Friends and relatives\n"
"§3 works the same way, except that you must first prove §4 before you can\n"
"continue with the main proof."
msgstr ""
"用 §0 你会开启一段证明，在其中你要展示：想要的目标可以由 §1 推出。\n"
"之后你再证明 §2。\n"
"\n"
"## 相关策略\n"
"§3 也一样，只不过你得先证明 §4，然后才能继续主证明。"

#. §0: `symm`
#. §1: `=`
#. §2: `↔`
#. §3: `symm at h`
#. §4: `h`
#. §5: `h.symm`
#. §6: `symm at h`
#. §7: `h`
#. §8: `rw [←h]`
#. §9: ```
#.   symm at h
#.   rw [h]
#.   ```
#. §10: `rw [h.symm]`
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:572
msgid ""
"With §0 (for “symmetry”), you swap the sides of an equation (§1) or equivalence (§2) in the proof target.\n"
"\n"
"## Variants\n"
"* §3 operates on the assumption §4 instead of the proof target\n"
"* §5 is the result of §6 and can be used like §7\n"
"\n"
"Each of the following three tactics or tactic sequences therefore has the same effect:\n"
"* §8\n"
"* §9\n"
"* §10"
msgstr ""
"用 §0（表示“symmetry”）你可以在目标里交换一个等式（§1）或等价（§2）的左右两边。\n"
"\n"
"## 变体\n"
"* §3 作用在假设 §4 上，而不是作用在目标上\n"
"* §5 是 §6 的结果，并且可以像 §7 一样使用\n"
"\n"
"所以接下来的三种策略/策略序列效果都一样：\n"
"* §8\n"
"* §9\n"
"* §10"

#. §0: `trans`
#. §1: `⊢ A = C`
#. §2: `trans B`
#. §3: `⊢ A = B`
#. §4: `⊢ B = C`
#. §5: `⊢ A ↔ C`
#. §6: `trans B`
#. §7: `⊢ A ↔ B`
#. §8: `⊢ B ↔ C`
#. §9: `A = B₁ = B₂ = B₃ … = C`
#. §10: `calc`
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:589
msgid ""
"With §0, you insert an intermediate step into an equation or equivalence.\n"
"\n"
"| before | tactic    | after                |\n"
"|:------------ |:--------- |:----------------------- |\n"
"| §1    | §2 | §3 and §4 |\n"
"| §5    | §6 | §7 and §8 |\n"
"\n"
"Since you can repeat the tactic several times, it is suitable for\n"
"performing a “calculation” §9 step by step.\n"
"\n"
"(Outside of the game, however, the multi-line tactic §10 is better suited for such calculations.)"
msgstr ""
"用 §0 你可以在一个等式或等价之间插入一个中间步骤。\n"
"\n"
"| 之前         | 策略   | 之后                   | \n"
"|:------------ |:-------- |:-----------------------| \n"
"| §1           | §2       | §3 和 §4               | \n"
"| §5           | §6       | §7 和 §8               | \n"
"\n"
"因为你可以多次重复这个策略，它很适合一步一步做一串“计算” §9。\n"
"\n"
"（不过在游戏外，做这种计算更推荐用多行策略 §10。）"

#. §0: `decide`
#. §1: `True`
#. §2: `Even 4`
#. §3: `2 ≤ 5`
#. §4: `4 ≠ 6`
#. §5: `Prime 7`
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:604
msgid ""
"With §0, you can prove statements that can be decided using a simple algorithm.\n"
"These include, in particular, §1 and statements about concrete numbers such as:\n"
"- §2\n"
"- §3\n"
"- §4\n"
"- §5"
msgstr ""
"用 §0 你可以证明那些能用简单算法判定的命题。\n"
"其中尤其包括 §1，以及关于具体数字的命题，比如：\n"
"* §2\n"
"* §3\n"
"* §4\n"
"* §5"

#. §0: `unfold F`
#. §1: `F`
#. §2: `unfold F at h`
#. §3: `h`
#. §4: `unfold`
#. §5: `push Not`
#. §6: `rw`
#. §7: `unfold F`
#. §8: `simp only [F]`
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:616
msgid ""
"With §0, you can write out the definition §1 in the proof goal.\n"
"With §2, you do the same thing, but in the assumption §3.\n"
"\n"
"Although the proof goal or assumption before and after §4 are identical in definition,\n"
"many tactics (e.g., §5 or §6) operate on a syntactic level;\n"
"they do not “see through definitions.”\n"
"\n"
"## Friends and Relatives\n"
"\n"
"The tactics §7 and §8 do practically the same thing."
msgstr ""
"用 §0 你可以在目标里把定义 §1 展开。\n"
"用 §2 你做同样的事，不过是在假设 §3 里。\n"
"\n"
"虽然在 §4 前后，目标或假设在定义上是等价的，但很多 tactic（比如 §5 或者 §6）是在语法层面操作的，它们“看不穿定义”。\n"
"\n"
"## 相关策略\n"
"\n"
"策略 §7 和 §8 基本上做的是同一件事。"

#. §0: `∃x, P x`
#. §1: `use x`
#. §2: `P x`
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:632
msgid ""
"If the proof target is of the form §0, you can use §1 to specify a concrete element\n"
"for which you want to prove §2."
msgstr "如果证明目标是形如 §0 的，你可以用 §1 给出一个具体元素，并且对它证明 §2。"

#. §0: `tauto`
#. §1: `generalize`
#. §2: `tauto`
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:638
msgid ""
"The tactic §0 proves logical tautologies.\n"
"\n"
"# Friends and relatives\n"
"\n"
"Sometimes the proof target must first be abstracted with §1 so that §2 recognizes the tautology."
msgstr ""
"策略 §0 证明逻辑重言式。\n"
"\n"
"# 相关策略\n"
"\n"
"有时得先用 §1 把目标抽象一下，这样 §2 才能认出这是个重言式。"

#. §0: `fun_prop`
#. §1: `Continuous`
#. §2: `Measurable`
#. §3: `Differentiable`
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:647
msgid ""
"The tactic §0 automatically discharges function-property goals such as §1,\n"
"§2, or §3."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `h₁ : ∀ᶠ x in 𝓕, p₁ x`
#. §1: `∀ᶠ x in 𝓕, p x`
#. §2: `filter_upwards [h₁]'`
#. §3: `p₁ x → p x`
#. §4: `filter_upwards [h₁, ⋯, hₙ]`
#. §5: `hᵢ : ∀ᶠ x in 𝓕, pᵢ x`
#. §6: `p₁ x → ⋯ → pₙ x → p x`
#. §7: `filter_upwards [h₁, ⋯, hₙ] with x h₁' ⋯ hₙ'`
#. §8: `filter_upwards`
#. §9: `intro x h₁' ⋯ hₙ'`
#. §10: `∀ᶠ`
#. §11: `filter_upwards [h₁, h₂] with x h₁' h₂'`
#. §12: ```
#. h₁ : ∀ᶠ x in 𝓕, p₁ x
#. h₂ : ∀ᶠ x in 𝓕, p₂ x
#. ⊢ ∀ᶠ x in 𝓕, p x
#. ```
#. §13: ```
#. x : …
#. h₁ : p₁ x
#. h₂ : p₂ x
#. ⊢ p x
#. ```
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:653
msgid ""
"Suppose we have an \"eventual\" hypothesis §0\n"
"and an \"eventual\" goal §1.\n"
"The tactic §2 reduces the goal to the point-wise implication §3.\n"
"\n"
"# Variants\n"
"\n"
"- §4 works in the same way: given several \"eventual\" hypotheses\n"
"   §5, the goal is reduced to §6.\n"
"- §7 follows the tactic §8 with\n"
"  §9.\n"
"   So the total effect on the proof state is that §10 is removed.\n"
"   For example, §11 turns\n"
"§12\n"
"    into\n"
"§13"
msgstr ""

#. §0: `h`
#. §1: `convert h`
#. §2: `h`
#. §3: `h`
#. §4: ```
#. h : HasDerivAt f a x
#. ⊢ HasDerivAt g a x
#. ```
#. §5: `convert h`
#. §6: ```
#. ⊢ g = f
#. ```
#. §7: `convert ← h`
#. §8: `f = g`
#. §9: `convert h using n`
#. §10: `h`
#. §11: `n`
#. §12: `convert`
#. §13: `convert! h`
#: Game/Doc/Tactic.lean:681
msgid ""
"If a hypothesis §0 is almost the goal, §1 closes the goal using §2\n"
"and creates new goals for the places where the goal and §3 differ.\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"§4\n"
"After §5, it remains to show\n"
"§6\n"
"\n"
"## Variants\n"
"\n"
"- §7 creates the new goals in the opposite direction (here §8).\n"
"- §9 only compares the goal and §10 up to depth §11.\n"
"  Use it when §12 breaks the goal into too many small (or even false) pieces.\n"
"- §13 additionally closes new goals that hold by definition."
msgstr ""

#: Game/Levels/Logo/L01_Tauto.lean:21
msgid "Intro Logo L01"
msgstr ""
"你们刚刚降落在洛格温女王的星球上。她开门见山地问道：\n"
"\n"
"**洛格温**：来自异世界的诸位，欢迎来到Lean宇宙！请允许我只问一个问题。为什么成立……\n"
"\n"
"说着，她在一张纸上草草写下几行：上面是一些假设，下面是一个结论。中间显然要你填进一个证明。你无助地看向司南。"

#. §0: `«{A}» «{B}» «{C}» : Prop`
#. §1: `«{A}»`
#. §2: `«{B}»`
#. §3: `«{C}»`
#. §4: `→`
#. §5: $⇒$
#. §6: `tauto`
#: Game/Levels/Logo/L01_Tauto.lean:41
msgid ""
"Explain that §0 introduces statements §1, §2 und §3 as\n"
"propositions. The symbol §4 is equivalent to the implication symbol §5. Try §6."
msgstr ""
"**司南**：这很简单。她写的 §0 意思是：§1、§2和§3是一些陈述（*propositions*）。而§4指的是§5，也就是“蕴涵”。其他符号你都认识吧？\n"
"\n"
"**你**：呃……认识是认识。但我还是得先想一想。\n"
"\n"
"**司南** *(小声)*：你就直接说这是个重言式不就完了。\n"
"\n"
"**你**：认真的？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：对。直接写§6。\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：快点……"

#. §0: `tauto`
#: Game/Levels/Logo/L01_Tauto.lean:53
msgid "Conclusion Logo L01: Remind that §0 cannot be used"
msgstr ""
"**洛格温** *(有些错愕)*：嗯，严格来说没错。\n"
"但你们可别以为靠这一招就能在*这个*星球上走多远！\n"
"我的臣民可不懂 §0。\n"
"你们得再多费点功夫才行。"

#. §0: $42 = 42$
#: Game/Levels/Logo/L02_Rfl.lean:20
msgid "Intro Logo L02: Why is §0?"
msgstr ""
"与此同时，臣民们已经排起了长队，都急着想提问。洛格温招手叫第一个人上前。他清了清嗓子。\n"
"\n"
"**臣民**：为什么 §0 成立？\n"
"\n"
"你一脸难以置信地看着他。他又把问题写给你看。"

#. §0: `rfl`
#: Game/Levels/Logo/L02_Rfl.lean:28
msgid "Remind: Equality is reflexive, so try §0"
msgstr "**司南**: 显然。你只要提醒他：相等关系是*自反*的。试试 §0。"

#: Game/Levels/Logo/L02_Rfl.lean:37
msgid "Conclusion Logo L02"
msgstr "**臣民**：啊，对。是的，您说得没错。我老是忘。rfl, rfl, rfl …."

#: Game/Levels/Logo/L03_Assumption.lean:15
msgid "Intro Logo L03"
msgstr ""
"第一个臣民还在嘀咕 rfl, rfl, rfl 的时候，下一个已经走上前来。\n"
"他很害羞，只用书写交流。"

#. §0: `«{n}» : ℕ`
#. §1: `«{n}»`
#. §2: `«{n}» ∈ ℕ`
#. §3: `«{h₁}»`
#. §4: `«{h₂}»`
#. §5: `«{h₃}»`
#. §6: `n < 10`
#. §7: `1 < n`
#. §8: `n ≠ 5`
#. §9: `1 < n`
#. §10: `assumption`
#: Game/Levels/Logo/L03_Assumption.lean:40
msgid ""
"Explain that §0 means §1 is a natural number. The notation §2 is not used.\n"
"§3, §4, §5 are names for the respective assumptions §6, §7 und §8.\n"
"The proof goal is §9. Try §10"
msgstr ""
"**司南**：§0 的意思是，§1 是一个自然数。\n"
"\n"
"**你**：那他为什么不直接写 §2？？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：因为这里的类型都挺奇怪的 ….\n"
"我之后再慢慢跟你解释。现在我先把问题解读出来。\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：所以，§3、§4、§5 只是不同假设的名字，分别对应假设 §6、§7 和 §8。我们要证明的是：§9。\n"
"\n"
"**你**：可那不就是其中一个已知假设吗？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：对，没错。\n"
"\n"
"**你**：？？？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：你得把这一点明确告诉他。用 §10 试试。"

#: Game/Levels/Logo/L03_Assumption.lean:52
msgid "Conclusion Logo L03"
msgstr "**臣民**：对，没错！你们都不知道，这个问题我琢磨了多久！"

#: Game/Levels/Logo/L04_Assumption.lean:14
msgid "Intro Logo L04"
msgstr "第三个臣民带着下面这个问题来了。"

#. §0: `«{A}» : Prop`
#. §1: `«{A}»`
#. §2: `«{hA}»`
#. §3: `«{A}»`
#. §4: `«{A}»`
#: Game/Levels/Logo/L04_Assumption.lean:26
msgid ""
"Explain that §0 means that §1 is some statement.\n"
"§2 is the name of the assumption that §3 is true. Try to solve §4 using said assumption"
msgstr ""
"**司南**：这里 §0 还是表示 §1 是某个陈述。而 §2 是一个名字，用来指代“§3为真”这个假设。\n"
"\n"
"**你**：也就是说，我们要在这个假设下，证明 §4？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：对。你现在能自己想出来怎么做了吧？"

#. §0: `assumption`
#: Game/Levels/Logo/L04_Assumption.lean:33
msgid "Use §0 as goal is in assumptions"
msgstr "**司南**：这和刚才那个问题一样：要证明的陈述本身就在已知假设里。所以§0这次也能用。"

#: Game/Levels/Logo/L04_Assumption.lean:39
msgid "Conclusion Logo L04"
msgstr "**臣民**：这也太快了。真棒！非常感谢。"

#: Game/Levels/Logo/L05_True.lean:14
msgid "Intro Logo L05"
msgstr "队伍里的下一个臣民是个捣蛋鬼。"

#. §0: `True`
#. §1: `decide`
#: Game/Levels/Logo/L05_True.lean:26
msgid "Explain that §0 is a special statement that is always true. Try §1"
msgstr ""
"**司南**：这个§0是个特殊的陈述，也就是那个永远、无条件为真的陈述。\n"
"\n"
"**你**：那到底要证明什么？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：我想，什么都不用。试试 §1 吧。"

#. §0: `decide`
#. §1: `decide`
#: Game/Levels/Logo/L05_True.lean:40
msgid "Conclusion Logo L05: §0 cannot be used every time. §1 works only in special cases"
msgstr ""
"**捣蛋鬼**：只是想看看你们脑子还算不算灵光 ….\n"
"\n"
"**你** *(对司南说)*：我们不能干脆一直用这个 §0 吗？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：不行，§1 只在一些特殊情况下才管用——也就是存在一个简单算法，能判定这个陈述是真是假。"

#: Game/Levels/Logo/L06_Not.lean:14
msgid "Intro Logo L06"
msgstr "捣蛋鬼还带来了自己的姐妹。"

#. §0: `¬`
#. §1: `(A : Prop)`
#. §2: `¬A`
#. §3: `False`
#. §4: `decide`
#: Game/Levels/Logo/L06_Not.lean:30
msgid ""
"Explain that §0 is the negation sign. If §1 is true than §2 is false and\n"
"vica versa. §3 is the statement that is always false. Try §4"
msgstr ""
"**司南**：这个符号 §0 表示否定。也就是说，如果命题 §1 是真的，那 §2 就是假的，反过来也一样。\n"
"\n"
"**你**：那 §3 大概就是那个永远为假的命题？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：对，没错。\n"
"\n"
"**你**：那这不就又是 §4 了吗？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：试试看！"

#: Game/Levels/Logo/L06_Not.lean:40
msgid "Conclusion Logo L06"
msgstr "那位姐妹笑了笑，赶紧追着捣蛋鬼跑开了。"

#: Game/Levels/Logo/L07_Contradiction.lean:14
msgid "Intro Logo L07"
msgstr "接下来来了三个刁难者。第一个带来了这样一个问题："

#. §0: `«{A}»`
#. §1: `«{h}»`
#. §2: `False`
#. §3: `False`
#. §4: `False`
#. §5: `«{A}»`
#. §6: `True`
#. §7: `False`
#. §8: `contradiction`
#: Game/Levels/Logo/L07_Contradiction.lean:34
msgid ""
"Explain that §0 is a statement and §1 is the assumption that §2 is true.\n"
"Remind that §3 is always false. Explain that assumption §4 is false. As any statement\n"
"§5 can be proven from a false assumption. Point out contradiction between §6 and §7\n"
"by applying §8."
msgstr ""
"**你**：如果我没看错的话，§0 是一个陈述，而且我们还有一个叫 §1 的假设，它说….\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：…它说§2成立。\n"
"\n"
"**你**：我还以为§3永远不成立？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：对，没错。这个假设就是 §4，也就是假的。众所周知，从一个假的假设可以证明一切！尤其是我们要的陈述 §5。\n"
"\n"
"**你**：那我现在要怎么跟这个形式哲学家解释呢？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：我觉得你得提醒他：总是成立的 §6 和他的假设 §7 之间有矛盾。试试 §8。"

#. §0: `contradiction`
#: Game/Levels/Logo/L07_Contradiction.lean:51
