#: Game/Levels/Babylon.lean:41
msgid "Intro Babylon"
msgstr ""
"你们到达了一颗星球，上面无数石板被堆成了高得离谱的塔。整片景观像一个巨大的拼图，每一块石板都一丝不苟地搭在下面的石板上。有些塔高得连塔尖都看不见。很快你们也遇到了这颗星球的第一个居民。\n"
"\n"
"**巴比伦人**：欢迎来到*巴比伦*！\n"
"\n"
"**你**：哦……\n"
"\n"
"你心里隐隐有种不妙的感觉。\n"
"\n"
"**你**：你们确定这些塔稳吗？\n"
"\n"
"**巴比伦人**：百分百！\n"
"\n"
"**你**：那你们到底怎么建成这些杰作的？\n"
"\n"
"**巴比伦人**：很简单！一块石板接一块石板。"

#. §0: `f`
#. §1: `A`
#. §2: `A`
#. §3: `A`
#. §4: `f`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L01_CantorPowerset.lean:22
msgid ""
"Intro Cantor L01: Mapping §0 from §1 to the power set of §2, and the set\n"
"of all elements in §3, which are not located in its image under §4"
msgstr ""
"**康托尔**：……所以我们考虑一个映射 §0，从 §1 到 §2 的幂集，然后再看 §3 中所有那些在 §4 之下不落在其像里的元素所组成的集合……\n"
"\n"
"哦！观众。不是，*两*拨观众！听吧看吧，看吧惊叹吧。\n"
"\n"
"他从高礼帽里抽出一张纸条，把它折成一只燕子，然后让它飞到你们这边。\n"
"\n"
"**康托尔**：既然我已经有两拨观众了，你们也可以稍微参与一下，对吧？"

#. §0: `Set A`
#. §1: `A`
#. §2: `A`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L01_CantorPowerset.lean:42
msgid "§0 is akin to the power set of §1, more precisely, it is the type of all subsets of §2."
msgstr ""
"**你**：所以 §0 是 §1 的幂集吗？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：是的，差不多吧。它是 §2 的所有子集的集合——或者更准确地说，是类型。\n"
"\n"
"**你**：然后我要证明……啊哈。大概是个反证法，对吧？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：大概是。"

#. §0: `«{h}»`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L01_CantorPowerset.lean:49
msgid "And now disect §0"
msgstr "**康托尔**：对对对！现在把 §0 好好拆开……"

#. §0: `obtain`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L01_CantorPowerset.lean:51
msgid "Try §0 as always"
msgstr "**司南**：……和之前一样，用 §0。"

#. §0: `«{a}» ∈ «{f}» «{a}»`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L01_CantorPowerset.lean:54
msgid "Try proof by cases for §0"
msgstr "**你**：现在大概需要对 §0 做个分类讨论？"

#. §0: `by_cases h₁ : «{a}» ∈ «{f}» «{a}»`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L01_CantorPowerset.lean:56
msgid "That would be §0"
msgstr "**司南**：那就是 §0。"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L01_CantorPowerset.lean:64
msgid "This looks good!"
msgstr ""
"康托尔搓了搓手。\n"
"\n"
"**康托尔**：看起来不错！"

#. §0: `«{h₁}» : «{a}» ∈ «{f}» «{a}»`
#. §1: `have`
#. §2: `suffices : «{a}» ∉ «{f}» «{a}»`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L01_CantorPowerset.lean:77
msgid ""
"Remind that, assumpion §0 will be needed agian.\n"
"Try §1 or §2"
msgstr ""
"**康托尔**：好主意！差一点就对了！\n"
"不过你们马上还会用到原来的假设 §0。\n"
"\n"
"**司南**\n"
"：好的，退回去，用 §1 继续。\n"
"或者用 §2！"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L01_CantorPowerset.lean:96
msgid "Conclusion Cantor L01"
msgstr ""
"康托尔开心地拍起手来。\n"
"纸条像变魔术一样飞回他那里。"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L02_CantorPowerset.lean:25
msgid "Intro Cantor L02"
msgstr ""
"**康托尔**：注意了，这个思路其实还能更进一步！\n"
"\n"
"他把手伸进高礼帽里，掏出各种各样的东西。一把旧牙刷，一副纸牌，一只白兔……最后露出一张揉皱的纸条。\n"
"\n"
"**康托尔**：我的笔记原来在这儿！锵锵！我著名的对角线论证！\n"
"\n"
"他把纸条展开，小心地把最上面一行撕下来，让它飘飘荡荡地落到你们这边。然后他好奇地探身到舞台边缘，想看看你们在做什么。"

#. §0: `push Not`
#. §1: `intro f`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L02_CantorPowerset.lean:52
msgid "Start here with §0 and §1"
msgstr ""
"**你**：这个我以前见过！简单说：“幂集总是比集合本身更大。”我记得也是个反证法。\n"
"**司南**：是的，不过我会从 §0 和 §1 开始。"

#. §0: `f`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L02_CantorPowerset.lean:60
msgid "Is there a set, which is not hit by §0"
msgstr "**康托尔**：那，你们觉得呢？会不会有某个集合没有被 §0 命中？"

#. §0: `let s := { a | a ∉ «{f}» a }`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L02_CantorPowerset.lean:65
msgid "First, introduce set §0"
msgstr "**司南**：试试刚才那个集合吧！你可以先用 §0 把它引入。"

#. §0: `specialize «{hf}» «{s}»`
#. §1: `simp`
#. §2: `simp [«{s}»]`
#. §3: `simp`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L02_CantorPowerset.lean:74
msgid ""
"Try §0. When you apply §1 later, §2 allows §3 to look through\n"
"your defintions"
msgstr "**司南**：太棒了！现在你比如说可以直接用 §0 继续。等你之后用到 §1 的时候，你可以用 §2 来让 §3 透过你的定义往里看。"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L02_CantorPowerset.lean:80
msgid "Cantor expresses happiness"
msgstr "康托尔兴奋地蹦来蹦去。"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L02_CantorPowerset.lean:89
msgid "Try simp [«{s}»]"
msgstr ""
"**康托尔**：对！\n"
"\n"
"**你**：司南，我们现在不能用刚才那个结果吗？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：抱歉，刚才太快了！我可能忘了保存。"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L03_IsFixedPt_abs.lean:25
msgid "Intro Cantor L03"
msgstr ""
"**你**：可我还是没看出来这到底哪里“对角”了。\n"
"\n"
"**康托尔**：没有？那就注意了！我们再来一遍，这次  慢  慢  来。\n"
"\n"
"他又在高礼帽里翻找。一个指南针。一把小提琴。一盒鼻烟。\n"
"\n"
"**康托尔**：啊不，我们换个方式。\n"
"\n"
"他又一次把手深深伸进高礼帽里，掏出整整一摞纸。把它们扔给你们。你们把纸条一张接一张地看过去。"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L03_IsFixedPt_abs.lean:35
msgid "Conclusion Cantor L03"
msgstr ""
"**康托尔**：干得漂亮！\n"
"\n"
"他开始拿几株仙人掌抛来抛去，但显然他还是在某种程度上跟着你们的进度。"

#. §0: `|x|`
#. §1: `x`
#. §2: `IsFixedPt`
#. §3: `unfold`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L03_IsFixedPt_abs.lean:47
msgid ""
"§0 is the absolute value of the real number §1. The meaning of §2\n"
"can be found out by using §3."
msgstr "**司南**：所以 §0 就是实数 §1 的标准绝对值。至于 §2 是什么意思，你大概用 §3 就能搞清楚。"

#. §0: `IsFixedPt`
#. §1: `IsFixedPt f x`
#. §2: `f x = x`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L03_IsFixedPt_abs.lean:57
msgid "§0 means 'is fixed point'. §1 equates to §2"
msgstr ""
"**你**：呃……\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：§0 大概是指“is fixed point”。反正 §1 显然就是 §2 的意思。"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L03_IsFixedPt_abs.lean:63
msgid "So far so good"
msgstr "**司南**：到目前为止，都挺好。"

#. §0: `simp`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L03_IsFixedPt_abs.lean:70
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L03_IsFixedPt_abs.lean:75
msgid "§0 can used always"
msgstr "**司南**：§0 总是可以试试看。"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L04_fixedPoints_neg.lean:9
msgid "Intro Cantor L04"
msgstr " "

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L04_fixedPoints_neg.lean:17
msgid "Conclusion Cantor L04"
msgstr ""
"**康托尔**：继续保持！\n"
"\n"
"他把仙人掌换成了麻雀。"

#. §0: `fixedPoints f`
#. §1: `unfold`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L04_fixedPoints_neg.lean:33
msgid "See if §0 is the set of all fix points by using §1"
msgstr ""
"**你**：这里的 §0 应该就是所有不动点的集合？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：试试看——§1 应该又能帮上忙。"

#. §0: `unfold IsFixedPt`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L04_fixedPoints_neg.lean:40
msgid "Try again with §0"
msgstr "**司南**：看起来不错。现在最好马上再来一遍 §0。"

#. §0: `simp`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L04_fixedPoints_neg.lean:47
msgid "Again try §0"
msgstr "**司南**：再试试 §0。"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L05_IsFixedPt_not.lean:19
msgid "Conclusion Cantor L05"
msgstr ""
"**康托尔**：你们离真相更近了……\n"
"\n"
"麻雀——毫不意外——都飞走了。于是他又开始抛接仙人掌，还一边骑独轮车。"

#. §0: `¬`
#. §1: `Prop`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L05_IsFixedPt_not.lean:33
msgid ""
"The second §0 means the same as the first: logical negation. Interpret it as the self\n"
"mapping of the set §1 of all possible satements."
msgstr ""
"**你**：这里第二个 §0 是什么意思？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：跟第一个一样：逻辑否定。你可以把它看成是集合 §1 上的一个自映射，也就是对所有可能命题的集合做自映射。而这个映射当然没有不动点，因为一个命题怎么可能等于它的否定呢！"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L06_IsFixedPt_odd.lean:19
msgid "Conclusion Cantor L06"
msgstr ""
"康托尔又说了些什么，但你们忙着做问题，根本顾不上。\n"
"你们甚至都没注意到，他这会儿已经开始骑着独轮车飞起来了。"

#. §0: `f`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L06_IsFixedPt_odd.lean:34
msgid "Assumption says that §0 is an 'uneven' function is"
msgstr ""
"**你**：我以前见过类似的——这个假设说 §0 是“一 个 奇 函 数”。\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：那就开始吧。我想你在这里不会需要任何我们没见过的东西。"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L07_idempotent.lean:18
msgid "Conclusion Cantor L07"
msgstr ""
"**康托尔**：喂，你们弄完了吗？？\n"
"\n"
"**司南**：我们还剩一张纸条。"

#. §0: `unfold range fixedPoints IsFixedPt`
