#. §1: `simp`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L07_idempotent.lean:67
msgid "Try either §0 or §1"
msgstr "**司南**：§0 也许有用？或者 §1？"

#. §0: `A × A`
#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L08_CantorDiag_IsFixedPt.lean:20
msgid "Intro Cantor L08: Mapping defined on product §0 with diagonal"
msgstr ""
"康托尔落地，从车上下来，又回到舞台边缘，搓了搓手。\n"
"\n"
"**康托尔**: 你们现在离真相更近了！仔细看，你们面前有一个定义在积 §0 上的映射！而这个积里有一条对角线！"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L08_CantorDiag_IsFixedPt.lean:32
msgid "Conclusion Cantor L08"
msgstr ""
"**康托尔**：很好！\n"
"\n"
"他鼓掌。\n"
"\n"
"**你**：所以我现在完全看不懂了。"

