#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L08_CantorDiag_IsFixedPt.lean:74
msgid ""
"§0 was replaced by §1. It is probably necessary to rewrite the second\n"
"appearnace of §2 in the goal. Try §3"
msgstr ""
"**司南**：现在你基本上把 §0 的两个出现都用 §1 替换掉了。\n"
"这样你就在原地打转。\n"
"你大概只想把目标里的第二个 §0 改写掉。\n"
"用 §3 来做。"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L09_CantorDiag.lean:22
msgid "Intro Cantor L09 - 2"
msgstr ""
"**康托尔**：注意！一切都会明白的。这就是钥匙！你们只要把刚才那句话稍微变形一下就行。\n"
"\n"
"他朝你们扔来一张新的纸条。"

#: Game/Levels/Cantor/L09_CantorDiag.lean:29
msgid "Conclusion Cantor L09 - 2"
msgstr "**康托尔**：太棒了！"

#. §0: `s : «{Y}» → «{Y}»`
